diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 25e668a..481497c 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,4 +1,7 @@
 # reports
 
-`python3 reports.py < ledger.csv` prints `account,total_cents`, one row per
-account in alphabetical order, from the CSV that `ledger` exports.
+`python3 reports.py < ledger.csv` prints `account,currency,total_cents`, one
+row per account and currency, sorted by account then currency. It reads both
+the current ledger CSV format and older CSV files without a `currency` column;
+older files are treated as USD. Invalid currency codes produce an error on
+stderr and exit status 2.
